se.\u201d\\n\\nThus began the odyssey of one A\u2019Ziah King, aka ZOLA. From acclaimed writer/director Janicza Bravo, Zola's stranger than fiction saga, which she first told in a now iconic series of viral, uproarious tweets, comes to dazzling cinematic life.\\n\\nZola (newcomer Taylour Paige), a Detroit waitress, strikes up a new friendship with a customer, Stefani (Riley Keough), who seduces her to join a weekend of dancing and partying in Florida. What at first seems like a glamorous trip full of \u201choeism\u201d rapidly transforms into a 48-hour journey involving a nameless pimp, an idiot boyfriend, some Tampa gangsters and other unexpected adventures in this wild, see-it-to-believe-it tale.\",\"translations\":[]},\"shortSynopsis\":{\"text\":\"A stripper named Zola embarks on a wild road trip to Florida.\",\"translations\":[]},\"censorRatingId\":\"HO00000005\",\"censorRatingNote\":{\"text\":\"strong sex, sexual violence\",\"translations\":[]},\"releaseDate\":\"2026-02-13\",\"runtimeInMinutes\":86,\"trailerUrl\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jrQFYJPkp_U\",\"displayPriority\":50,\"castAndCrew\":[{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000000807\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001072\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001073\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001074\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001075\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001076\",\"roles\":[\"Actor\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001077\",\"roles\":[\"Director\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001078\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001079\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001080\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001081\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001082\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]},{\"castAndCrewMemberId\":\"0000001083\",\"roles\":[\"Producer\"]}],\"genreIds\":[\"0000000002\"],\"ex